Boss Wars balans-pass (anvandar-ja 2026-06-07)

- Tier-graderat per-hit-dmg-tak ersatter platt 5%: T1 6% -> T5 4%
  (alla bossar var ~20 hits oavsett tier; HP-talen var kosmetiska).
- T5 one-shot-nerf: dmgScale 3.5->3.0 + fas-2-mul (DRAGON_P2_DMG_MUL) 1.30->1.15.
- Soul Link: orb-dmg 0.15->0.10, brytfonster 1.5->2.0s (mobil-marginal).
- Meteor Riddle: countdown 5->6s (gata+spring for snalt pa mobil).

Speglat i bade server/game-engine.js (MP) och main.js (solo/klient).

